0..48 Comment "//! A fold that the symmetry of a purse refuses."
49..52 Comment "//!"
53..130 Comment "//! Two purses in one purse have no order. The check reads the call of a fold"
131..206 Comment "//! at a variable of the rule as one value. That reading must admit no fold"
207..262 Comment "//! that gives the two orders of one purse two answers."
263..266 Comment "//!"
267..343 Comment "//! A fold that answers with its value on the first purse gives the value of"
344..421 Comment "//! one variable on one side of the rule, and the value of the other variable"
422..493 Comment "//! on the other side. No rule joins two such values, so the fold stays"
494..506 Comment "//! refused."
507..510 Comment "//!"
511..527 Comment "//! - see: #8367"
528..605 Comment "//! - see: `model/desc/fold-swaps-variables.gandr` — the folds that respect"
606..620 Comment "//!   the rule"
622..651 Comment "// `Purse` with its symmetry."
